WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.950
Somewhere at Rollins is the right faculty mentor for you.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.200
But who?

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.060
And what do you even say?

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.800
Meet CampusOtter.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.600
Find your faculty mentor.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:12.950
Know what to say.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.400
Tell it what you want to work on.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.630
It searches the expertise of 265 Rollins faculty

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.000
and shows who matches, and why.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.950
Next, it reads their recent work and your CV,

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.950
and drafts a first email worth answering.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.500
You send it yourself.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.800
Before the meeting, you get a one-page brief:

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.940
what to read first, how to describe your own work,

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.600
and questions to ask.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.900
And it never guesses.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:45.250
Everything it says about faculty comes from their profile.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.660
From “Who do I ask?”

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.600
to a meeting on the calendar.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.700
CampusOtter.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.540
Sign in with your Emory email

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.970
at campusotter.vercel.app.
